Include:

Title / header (use standard header)

Executive summary (1 short paragraph)

Scope & Method (what was tested)

Findings table — create a Word table with these columns:

Control Area | Checklist Item | Status (Pass/Partial/Fail) | Evidence | Priority | Recommended Action | Owner | Due Date

Sample table row:

Control Area	Checklist Item	Status	Evidence	Priority	Recommended Action	Owner	Due Date
Patch management	Workstations patched within 14 days	Fail	Device_List shows 4/15 with old patch date	High	Implement automated patch schedule; patch unpatched hosts	IT	2026-01-15

Remediation plan — numbered list with time estimates (hours) and priority

Appendix: Evidence — list screenshot filenames and file paths

Save as Gap_Assessment_Report_Template_v1.docx. When running evaluation, save a filled copy Evaluation/Gap_Assessment_AcmeWidgets.docx.
